CK NOTE</h6><p><br></p><p>We recommend consulting your healthcare provider before adding any supplements to your routine, particularly if you have any health conditions or are taking medications.</p><p>Have more questions? See our FAQs.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<!-- -->{% assign product = reploOriginalProductR1r32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSelectedVariant = reploOriginalProductVariantR1r32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSortedSellingPlans = reploOriginalSPGR1r32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSelectedSellingPlan = reploOriginalSSPR1r32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSelectedSellingPlanPrice = reploOriginalSSPPriceR1r32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploCompareAtPriceDifferencePercentage = reploOriginalComparePricePercentR1r32 %}<!-- -->{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}</div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5aa85531-c694-48c7-ac25-9922092e3090" class="r-1gedypb"><div data-rid="6d29aace-8ed2-4f68-a43b-b508c1dae686" class="r-1irlpa7"><div data-rid="cfc73458-1731-430e-9b6b-47ae84189bbc" class="r-g1plal alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>frequently asked questions</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="8ae1998c-78e5-4c95-9e3c-25c1a840778f" class="r-1ibhosu"><div data-rid="ec29743d-115d-4bc0-b7d3-6fbdd057c0a3" class="r-1rz47yw" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="c7ab85b9-3807-4cb1-a114-2130e43d8b85" aria-controls="replo-:R1jj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-avvpmj"><div data-rid="4649f3a6-4f22-450f-beea-72f62b84adc6" class="r-7416z1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is the Longevity Shot made of?</p></span></div><div data-rid="edfdd5e7-8af2-48b3-ac19-4f90fd50f442" class="r-3d4p83"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1u114i5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1jj2:"><div data-rid="e15a8936-563b-4b08-af00-e8fab239c547" class="r-g6jfk6"><div data-rid="da2559ee-2855-470d-a114-737819c98767" class="r-1y2c76a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot is crafted entirely from all-natural ingredients, with 80% of the ingredients being non-GMO. It is gluten-free, vegan, caffeine-free, soy-free, and dairy-free, with no synthetic ingredients, artificial sweeteners, preservatives, or artificial colors/flavors. Each shot contains 18 calories per serving.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6a24661b-b2f2-4f75-9f53-619a947dcc6c" class="r-h9015k" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="7cdae060-e014-4217-97ed-9542a5274a2e" aria-controls="replo-:R2jj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1vmcm92"><div data-rid="75dc8041-ce4d-461e-98fd-17df52f66ba0" class="r-1nimjr3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How should I take the Longevity Shot, and when is the best time?</p></span></div><div data-rid="09163e14-0f05-4a6b-8990-37ac9f8a4fea" class="r-10q4keu"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-l9veoc" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2jj2:"><div data-rid="48b1f0de-60df-40f2-bd29-5670c8be4424" class="r-bkf9zi"><div data-rid="a94cb9ed-6bc0-4580-ae78-9ff24256cc43" class="r-13xc1dx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>For optimal results, we recommend taking two shots per week, at any time of the day. This schedule helps maintain NAD+ levels and activate sirtuins—proteins vital for cellular health, DNA repair, and metabolic function. This intermittent dosing supports long-term vitality and overall longevity, slowing the aging process without overwhelming your body.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c7db9d8f-dcc5-42b3-9868-593487a97f73" class="r-69o3bs" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="d9b7cd74-ea98-4e78-9845-2f2e6312055f" aria-controls="replo-:R3jj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-vra3yv"><div data-rid="9e9e6104-dcd9-4fec-b66a-456cdce40a35" class="r-rcfcyr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>When will I see results from the Longevity Shot?</p></span></div><div data-rid="cbdae7da-2b64-4a5a-a547-708e6ba8c328" class="r-osrcs7"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-y82vvb" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3jj2:"><div data-rid="9034b515-e52a-4f61-98c8-6dfb17015c67" class="r-w43cd3"><div data-rid="d5cd99bb-ff84-4c62-ab93-57dffb571a46" class="r-1s88y3r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The timing of results can vary depending on your body and lifestyle. Many women begin to notice positive changes in energy, skin health, and overall well-being within the first 30 days of regular use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c4577acb-ae2f-43ea-af28-a8c2f1a72420" class="r-q0k5sa" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="363bc7b7-5d7d-490d-96db-907b2103b66c" aria-controls="replo-:R4jj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-o3buot"><div data-rid="de6585fc-9469-483f-a239-30b22308896c" class="r-1j5o7ou alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long should I continue taking the Longevity Shot?</p></span></div><div data-rid="7526eb6f-aa98-40c7-b907-dc5e2882e07e" class="r-rghjhw"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1ql67zi" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4jj2:"><div data-rid="1f8b221d-5633-4599-95c6-35cddf18eb88" class="r-ijw85i"><div data-rid="c3f40bf0-c117-416f-983a-2259febf090b" class="r-arj9st alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The long-term benefits of the Longevity Shot—such as cellular health support and slowing the aging process—are best experienced over time with consistent use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a5fad250-54ca-4c3d-bd42-b350693045f7" class="r-15fj148" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="a39eb67a-9af3-4fc5-ac5b-b88e025da6aa" aria-controls="replo-:R5jj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-b7csh8"><div data-rid="ef5a78c0-6286-4284-bae5-d66f0b73c274" class="r-l196h1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are there any side effects of interactions with medications?</p></span></div><div data-rid="1774d0af-15b0-4501-acfa-78e0c9459bd1" class="r-hubwrj"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1rop220" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5jj2:"><div data-rid="8a406c42-133c-4ece-875e-c2898b65f74e" class="r-15r5w7a"><div data-rid="64466ec7-e53b-481a-9b06-86198ce3558a" class="r-10g7rvy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The natural ingredients in the Longevity Shot are generally well-tolerated, but everyone is unique. If you’re taking any prescription medications or have a medical condition, particularly autoimmune conditions, we encourage you to consult your healthcare provider before starting the Longevity Shot.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d75cc706-abec-425e-b2d7-988322827669" class="r-jiuqd8" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="9f7bc69d-b817-48aa-8722-45483d7f96c3" aria-controls="replo-:R6jj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-9ye4gg"><div data-rid="0dedbeb2-6d82-4c13-a33e-fd00ffa87282" class="r-1u4qk5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Does the Longevity Shot contain sugar or alcohol?</p></span></div><div data-rid="ce392a21-b2d5-4403-9d4b-bef3bdd05948" class="r-1ez8sic"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1dmapjx" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R6jj2:"><div data-rid="742cc857-a419-4ee2-9f5a-50f0bbbe1bd3" class="r-1rgscgx"><div data-rid="a2713bf9-2ec5-4b77-97b8-e458ee91052c" class="r-spk41m alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot contains 2.5 grams of natural sugar from apple and grape juice concentrate. It is also lightly sweetened with steviol glycosides, a natural sweetener derived from the Stevia rebaudiana plant that is sugar and calorie-free. It is alcohol-free.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5f331e5f-f6b7-49e9-bb6b-1be3017c789d" class="r-sba1ga" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="2bf90c38-e623-4e37-b1c4-b5bece6529a3" aria-controls="replo-:R7jj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-v8rey4"><div data-rid="c72b4235-a1be-4f76-a141-1ba213142d05" class="r-p9y8z5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take the Longevity Shot if I’m pregnant or breastfeeding?</p></span></div><div data-rid="0808e13c-2161-45f6-ab3f-596feb63da5a" class="r-kqes0r"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-oczy7j" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7jj2:"><div data-rid="f75d42b2-99a3-4967-8d86-3c92942a13e9" class="r-qqxyu8"><div data-rid="5ad62b9b-7afb-45be-baaf-ebb690aaec44" class="r-x6723i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>While the Longevity Shot is made with natural ingredients, we always recommend that pregnant or breastfeeding women consult their healthcare provider to ensure it aligns with their unique health needs during this time.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="29c80772-ef56-43f0-94c2-5b0763332513" class="r-ao9rif" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="50b8b158-0480-4e69-9150-424b2c5f669b" aria-controls="replo-:R8jj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1q9rhh8"><div data-rid="9cfdd86d-babb-4478-b68b-e8e8b3b4599c" class="r-1735xlh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shot suitable for children or teenagers?</p></span></div><div data-rid="96b3ebf5-46d0-4855-a7f2-14ccecbce1f9" class="r-1jz0rgw"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-k04q1t" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R8jj2:"><div data-rid="a16d1877-cd9d-4597-8928-66f8bc4ea44f" class="r-ucg8bh"><div data-rid="3c49f073-db26-44a5-acf3-ea89481656a6" class="r-89t0tv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot is formulated with adults in mind. If you’re considering it for children or teenagers, we recommend speaking with a healthcare provider to ensure it’s appropriate for their needs.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="22a173f6-18e4-4c36-9f91-aad54bacae5e" class="r-18lxawy" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="68c31cea-f094-463a-b3f5-fbabf7dab77c" aria-controls="replo-:R9jj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-cetmkp"><div data-rid="f10faf7d-56b1-48d0-84b7-cd218c24796e" class="r-1af074u alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shot safe for those with allergies or dietary restrictions?</p></span></div><div data-rid="11d61a69-9f0e-4c62-9b7c-3bb0f3d56f7b" class="r-137cfif"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1l70d6n" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R9jj2:"><div data-rid="2b4db9e7-2b51-4d1c-8d46-54f7aabb0d1c" class="r-iclfxq"><div data-rid="849b538d-b074-483e-b1a1-00931af6a28d" class="r-vuj2t8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, the Longevity Shot is free from common allergens like nuts, soy, dairy, and gluten, making it suitable for most women with dietary sensitivities. Additionally, it can fit into most keto diets.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="e1de304c-9b7b-4fc2-993d-3efbfab22c1f" class="r-16nr7wh" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="830197a0-dbf8-40de-b0e6-4db5c96b50ff" aria-controls="replo-:Rajj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-i3zhzc"><div data-rid="3cf92217-964f-4607-bcaa-063aaa0fb352" class="r-199in6q alchemy-rte